f3186662fc07d .hr-inner{\nwidth:50px;\nborder-color:#ed1c24;\n}\n<\/style>\n<div  class='hr av-5xzy4m-f7cfbde6d3e910032aaf3186662fc07d hr-custom  avia-builder-el-1  el_after_av_heading  el_before_av_one_half  hr-left hr-icon-no'><span class='hr-inner inner-border-av-border-fat'><span class=\"hr-inner-style\"><\/span><\/span><\/div>\n<div class='flex_column_table av-cr086-5af7c6b828c855b3ea9949c2b0471bf2 sc-av_one_half av-equal-height-column-flextable'><div  class='flex_column av-cr086-5af7c6b828c855b3ea9949c2b0471bf2 av_one_half  avia-builder-el-2  el_after_av_hr  el_before_av_one_half  first flex_column_table_cell av-equal-height-column av-align-top  '     ><section  class='av_textblock_section av-mpnv8uk0-6e1dc016d52f6e0af01b9145fdba9501 '   itemscope=\"itemscope\" itemtype=\"https:\/\/schema.org\/BlogPosting\" itemprop=\"blogPost\" ><div class='avia_textblock'  itemprop=\"text\" ><p class=\"v1MsoNormal\"><strong>From June 22 to 26, 2026<\/strong>, we will be exhibiting at the China International Supply Chain Expo (CISCE) in Beijing.<\/p>\n<p class=\"v1MsoNormal\">This step is a milestone for us, made possible through our strategic cooperation with the Polish Investment and Trade Agency (PAIH).<\/p>\n<p class=\"v1MsoNormal\"><strong>Where to find us?<\/strong><\/p>\n<p>At the expo: Stop by our booth to talk business and check out what we&#8217;ve been working on.<\/p>\n<p>In the city: We are blocking out time for external meetings, networking, and coffee chats all week long.<\/p>\n<p class=\"v1MsoNormal\"><strong>The Details:<\/strong><\/p>\n<p>Event: 4th CISCE | cisce.org.cn<\/p>\n<p>Location: China International Exhibition Center (Shunyi Venue), Beijing<\/p>\n<p class=\"v1MsoNormal\">Let&#8217;s lock in a date!<\/p>\n<p class=\"v1MsoNormal\">Send us a quick message or connect directly to book a meeting.<\/p>\n<p class=\"v1MsoNormal\">See you in Beijing!<\/p>\n<\/div><\/section><\/div><div class='av-flex-placeholder'><\/div><div  class='flex_column av-26eoti-c197